<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050b18" />
  <meta name="description" content="Welcome to NOTDIBBO Gaming. Minecraft, GTA and more!" />
  <title>NOTDIBBO | Gaming Universe</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background: #050b18;
      color: #f4f8ff;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    header {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center; padding: 20px 8%;
      background: rgba(5,11,24,.94);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #15345c;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }
    .logo { font-size: 25px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .logo span { color: #00baff; }
    nav { display: flex; gap: 25px; }
    nav a { color: #b9c9e0; font-size: 14px; }
    nav a:hover { color: #00c8ff; }
    .hero {
      min-height: 590px; padding: 110px 8%;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 45%, #073e76 0%, transparent 48%),
        linear-gradient(120deg,#050b18,#091b35);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #123b67;
    }
    .tag {
      color: #00c8ff; border: 1px solid #007db5;
      padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 88px); line-height: 1.05; }
    h1 span { color: #00baff; text-shadow: 0 0 30px #007eff; }
    .hero p { color: #a9bdd8; max-width: 550px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 25px 0 30px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block; padding: 15px 27px;
      background: #008dff; border-radius: 7px;
      font-weight: bold; box-shadow: 0 0 25px #007eff55;
      transition: .2s;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: #00c8ff; transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .btn.secondary { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #168bdb; margin-left: 10px; }
    section { padding: 85px 8%; }
    .heading { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .heading span { color: #00baff; }
    .sub { color: #8fa6c5; margin-bottom: 35px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .about {
      background: #081326; border: 1px solid #16395e;
      padding: 30px; border-radius: 14px;
      color: #b4c6df; line-height: 1.9;
      max-width: 850px;
    }
    .cards {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }
    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg,#102440,#081326);
      border: 1px solid #19436d; border-radius: 13px;
      padding: 28px; transition: .25s;
    }
    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-7px);
      border-color: #00baff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px #008cff22;
    }
    .emoji { font-size: 43px; margin-bottom: 17px; }
    .card h3 { font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .card p { color: #9bb0cc; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px; }
    .social { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }
    footer {
      text-align: center; padding: 30px 15px;
      background: #030812; color: #8196b4;
      border-top: 1px solid #15345c;
      font-size: 13px; line-height: 2;
    }
    footer strong { color: #00baff; }
    @media(max-width:700px) {
      header { padding: 17px 5%; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; }
      nav { gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      nav a { font-size: 12px; }
      .hero { padding: 90px 6%; min-height: 530px; }
      section { padding: 65px 6%; }
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .btn.secondary { margin-left: 0; margin-top: 12px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a href="#" class="logo">NOT<span>DIBBO</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#games">Games</a>
      <a href="#videos">Videos</a>
      <a href="#social">Socials</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="tag">WELCOME TO MY GAMING UNIVERSE</div>
      <h1>LEVEL UP WITH<br /><span>NOTDIBBO.</span></h1>
      <p>
        Gaming, adventures and epic moments!
        Join me on my journey through Minecraft,
        GTA and many more exciting games.
      </p>
      <div>
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NotDIBBO" target="_blank">▶ SUBSCRIBE NOW</a>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="#games">EXPLORE</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
      <h2 class="heading">ABOUT <span>ME</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">Welcome to the world of NOTDIBBO.</p>
      <div class="about">
        Hey gamers! Welcome to NOTDIBBO, my gaming universe.
        Here you can discover gaming videos, adventures,
        challenges and entertaining moments. From Minecraft
        to GTA, there is always something exciting happening.
        Subscribe and become part of the community!
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="games">
      <h2 class="heading">MY <span>GAMES</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">Explore the games featured on my channel.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="emoji">⛏️</div>
          <h3>Minecraft</h3>
          <p>Survival, PvP, Bedwars, builds and crazy adventures.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="emoji">🚗</div>
          <h3>GTA</h3>
          <p>Open-world adventures, driving and exciting gameplay.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="emoji">🎮</div>
          <h3>More Games</h3>
          <p>Discover more gaming content and new adventures.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="videos">
      <h2 class="heading">LATEST <span>VIDEOS</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">Watch my gaming content on YouTube.</p>
      <div class="about">
        Ready for some epic gameplay?
        Visit my YouTube channel to watch my latest uploads!
        <br /><br />
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NotDIBBO" target="_blank">WATCH ON YOUTUBE ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="social">
      <h2 class="heading">JOIN THE <span>COMMUNITY</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">Follow NOTDIBBO and never miss an update.</p>
      <div class="social">
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NotDIBBO" target="_blank">▶ YouTube</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 <strong>NOTDIBBO</strong>. All rights reserved.<br />
    Built for gamers. Powered by passion. 🎮
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
